                  <PROPERTY NAME="DESCRIPTION" VALUE="Interrupt Mode Register.&#xA;For each bit:&#xA;  R - Reads interrupt mode.&#xA;  W - Sets interrupt mode, where 0 is normal mode and 1 is fast mode.&#xA;"/>
